This product includes a copy of fgb_module_api.h from FaceGaze Bridge
(https://github.com/Aqamoe/FaceGaze-Bridge), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. The header is resolved at build time from the release
pinned in sdk.lock.json; this repository does not contain a copy of it.

The wire format (message types, struct layouts, handshake and polling
sequence), the blink-to-openness formula and the pupil unit convention were
informed by the upstream VRCFT module PSVR2Toolkit.VRCFT
(https://github.com/BnuuySolutions/PSVR2Toolkit.VRCFT), MIT licensed. This
repository is an independent C++ implementation of that wire format and
contains none of its source code.

